  "question": {
    "text": "A string fixed at both ends has a standing wave mode for which the distances between adjacent nodes is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>cm.</mo></math> For the net consecutive standing wave mode distance between adjacent nodes is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>cm.</mo></math> The minimum possible length of the string is"
  },
